BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Heated Battle Mode: Sprinting Stratagems
DTSTART:20260606T020000Z
DTEND:20260621T195900Z
UID:21e5c13404105741e47214335648c3b5@hoyo-calendar
DESCRIPTION:At The Cat's Tail\, entertaining events are held regularly\, a
 nd each event will adopt a special set of Heated Battle Mode rules.\nThe r
 ules this time are as follows:\n1. You and your opponent will use Characte
 r Cards selected on the spot and randomly generated Action Cards to battle
 .\n2. During the Roll phase\, you will not roll Elemental Dice but instead
  will receive 4 Omni Dice and 4 different random Elemental Dice.\n3. Once 
 each round\, playing an Action Card will cost 2 fewer Elemental Dice.\n4. 
 Switching Character Cards is always a Fast Action.\n\n
END:VEVENT
